1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,423
1957. Florence, Oregon.

2
00:00:04,603 --> 00:00:09,810
A journalist flies over coastal dunes that swallow highways, forests, and houses.

3
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:15,349
He came to write an article about the men trying to stop them… with grass.

4
00:00:15,999 --> 00:00:17,131
He never finished it.

5
00:00:18,131 --> 00:00:26,433
His notes kept growing until they became something else: one of the best-selling science fiction novels in history.

6
00:00:26,613 --> 00:00:33,103
Nearly 70 years later, cinemas are preparing for the chapter his own readers didn't want to see.

7
00:00:33,653 --> 00:00:35,917
This is the story of Dune.
